2026-10-10 independent Metalio S31 port / 独立 Metalio S31 移植：

- LCD and render output use the supplied Metalio 2.0.76-debug implementation;
  its upstream MIT notice is retained in ../../licenses/Metalio-MIT.txt.
- RISC-V C equivalents replace Xtensa pixel routines; LUT and column masks
  retain the reference high-bit-first order on the 8-bit LCD bus.
- S31 AXI DMA/cache/IOMUX support; E0470A14-AF gate timing and 8px border filter.
- Producer ownership and atomic row readiness, bounded waits, underrun diagnostics,
  and a fixed 192-row S31 prefill preserve the independent renderer profile.
- RC90 line/column phase interfaces remain supported against the Metalio tables.

2026-10-17 test30: Added epd_clear_checked using the existing S31 3*(10 dark +13 white +3 hold), time15 native clear sequence. It stops on the first render error and reports it; original render timing/waveform tables are unchanged. Display repair commits a white reference only after successful clear, then presents one GC48 target.

2026-10-20 S31 local pipeline: idle Core1 whole-frame difference jobs with ownership return, pre-positioned1KiB lookup,128-row idle prefill,64-row internal DMA bounce buffers with bounded chained descriptors,and DMA/stale-VSYNC guards; original waveform data and scan timing retained.
2026-10-20 S31 follow-up: internal-RAM pointer-sized line queue tables and official cache-safe RGB/GDMA configuration; local-only200us SDK cache-guard tests do not write Flash.
